  {
   "id": 615825,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The ideas expressed by Abraham Lincoln in the excerpt had most in common with the ideas expressed in",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1171266,
     "content_html": "the philosophy on states’ rights in the Hartford Convention Resolutions"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171267,
     "content_html": "the relationship of the states in the Articles of Confederation"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171269,
     "content_html": "the idea of national unity in George Washington’s <i>Farewell Address</i>"
    },
    {
     "id": 1171268,
     "content_html": "James Monroe’s ideals on national authority expressed in the Monroe Doctrine"
    }
